     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap mii-cm-onko-grading-sct</b></p><a name=\"en-mii-cm-onko-grading-sct\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcmii-cm-onko-grading-sct\"> </a><p>Mapping from https://www.medizininformatik-initiative.de/fhir/ext/modul-onko/ to http://snomed.info/sct/900000000000207008/version/20240401</p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-mii-cs-onko-grading.html\">MII CS Onkologie Grading</a> to <code>http://snomed.info/sct/900000000000207008/version/20240401</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>0 (primär erworbene Melanose ohne zelluläre Atypien (nur beim malignen Melanom der Konjunktiva))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>415175000 (Primary acquired melanosis of conjunctiva without atypia (disorder))</td><td>Hier der Vollständigkeit aufgeführt.</td></tr><tr><td>1 (gut differenziert)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373375007 (Well differentiated histological grade finding (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2 (mäßig differenziert)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373377004 (Moderately differentiated histological grade finding (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>3 (schlecht differenziert)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373373000 (Poorly differentiated histological grade finding (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>4 (undifferenziert)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373374006 (Undifferentiated histological grade finding (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>5 (nur für C61, TNM8)</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">wird im derzeitigen oBDS nicht mehr kodiert, kein passender SNOMED CT Code notwendig</td></tr><tr><td>X (nicht bestimmbar)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1155705000 (GX: Histologic grade cannot be assessed (qualifier value))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>L (low grade (G1 oder G2))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1155708003 (Low histologic grade (qualifier value))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>M (intermediate grade (G2 oder G3))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1286893008 (Intermediate histologic grade (qualifier value))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>H (high grade (G3 oder G4))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1155707008 (High histologic grade (qualifier value))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>B (Borderline)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1268929003 (GB: Borderline tumor (qualifier value))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>U (unbekannt)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>261665006 (Unknown (qualifier value))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>T (trifft nicht zu)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equi